{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "294401018215b8ef32a02198054af52d18ca27aaadf2d5ba0a0fad9c69aa1d43", "ja": "ドント・フォーゲット", "zh": "别忘记", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "31ef911686a7339fd5340195325834076fed1e7d133b5664897c31b111f3b3a0", "ja": "公演が終わり、今日はPV撮影。当時を再現\nしたディスコを訪れた一同は、あの夜見たも\nのと変わらない風景に、タイムスリップはプ\nロデューサーのドッキリだったと結論づける\nのだった。", "zh": "公演结束后，今天要拍摄PV。众人来到了\n重现当时场景的迪斯科舞厅，看到与那晚\n所见别无二致的景象，最终得出结论：所谓\n穿越时空，其实是制作人策划的恶作剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4159b4ddefebdaa0e7c1a9ba9d0cef122b67316caa925712467bdd4788a0aca8", "ja": "（新曲の公演は大成功に終わった！\nさて、残すイベントと言えば……）", "zh": "（新曲公演圆满成功！\n那么，剩下的活动就是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a5683de4a963d9e04e0af7c99e82d51e740cb8d7539e62eb68a1262c852bfe35", "ja": "おはよう！\nみんな、もう揃ってるね！", "zh": "早上好！\n大家都已经到齐了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "6cc33c22d40a49b15a8fa4d7b5347c5ce8220c6163ffc182a60169820b80d556", "ja": "おはよっ！", "zh": "早啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "e7feedefcb6776558ed2a65ebef0c4680c67d91e3acd8b0a10e353a1e0688f58", "ja": "おはよー！", "zh": "早上好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "18f6c3018db548d5a908e50206bf70867f0d4d7b6478f09fcda2c663a7c9b6da", "ja": "おはよっ♪", "zh": "早上好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "f3e754b7065407c724aa3571f49953f0f466e6ca949218c166a5b9f884519b40", "ja": "あれ、このメンバーってことは……\nもしかして、ユニットのお仕事？", "zh": "咦，既然是这几个人……\n难道说，是有组合的工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d7589c9e9d5585d124199813f0ee0d4d36aff21b871d6dda41cb7a1ba8f2d76f", "ja": "ああ、まだPV撮影が残ってるからな。\n今日はリハーサルだけだけど。", "zh": "啊，因为还剩下PV拍摄嘛。\n不过今天只有彩排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "2f607987ce7fcf413df8b0e068e9ef0f376cd492e9a87af8113d7bead05f92c5", "ja": "そっか、PV撮影もあるんだよネ！\nみんなとお仕事できて、うれしいナ～♪", "zh": "这样啊，还要拍PV呢！\n能和大家一起工作，我好开心呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "ac1e3bc305f166e506878fc4460c2f6a2a5bdde6c03cb1aaeb4c75952f10acf4", "ja": "何事も、準備は大切だもんね。\nそれじゃあみんなで、レッツゴー☆", "zh": "无论做什么，准备都很重要嘛。\n那就和大家一起，出发吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "49fc96c3ce98422932a45ccba9853b4c4ef53f3965cb9c8ef85fc52eefa8a996", "ja": "わあ……！　これって、もしかして、\nディスコってとこ！？　かっこいい～！", "zh": "哇……！这里该不会就是\n传说中的迪斯科吧！？好帅气～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "cc63e02668e183c631e71c970cfa0c347c462ee98dac3c8059cfb1022046f7b1", "ja": "ミラーボールが、キラキラしてるヨ♪\nワタシたちのPV撮影は、ディスコでやるんだネ！", "zh": "迪斯科球闪闪发光呢♪\n我们要在迪斯科拍摄PV，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "731285812086e2edda4af4fe4b23b0e5ff571e1b9d11cb37e4ca158e1221d254", "ja": "あれ？　でも、なんだか雰囲気が……\n{$P$}、歩！　ここ、もしかして？", "zh": "奇怪？不过，总觉得气氛有点……\n{$P$}、步！这里该不会是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "231bc97542a5b480e063666aac8187e507752fadf4d33a896e283d2a1653b575", "ja": "驚いた……。タイムスリップした\n90年代で行った、あのディスコにそっくりだよ！", "zh": "好惊讶……和穿越到90年代时去过的那家迪斯科一模一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "be2ba6d4d29a03eb3b7f56c93ac66e48b51af3bfa414f047ce1f54dbabaf93d9", "ja": "当時有名だったディスコを再現したそうだ。\nこれも、リバイバルブームってやつだな。", "zh": "据说这里重现了当时非常有名的迪斯科舞厅。\n这也是所谓的复古风潮吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "36cd47aca983185b0dcaa69e564274cbed5b0aea09a0971507dd2a7880810e32", "ja": "じゃあアタシたち、またタイムスリップしちゃった\nわけじゃないんだよね？　びっくりしたぁ……。", "zh": "那我们并不是又穿越了吧？吓了我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b95b8717ea132ed3082442959e8e1661df1e1394caf4bb18cd78c830a983d516", "ja": "しかもできたばっかでピカピカ……あの時の\nディスコと、全然見分けがつかないくらいだよ！", "zh": "而且还是刚建成、崭新的样子……简直和那时候的迪斯科一模一样，完全分辨不出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "111f9950ed6b741f79c641bf8aa8e1802993b0330360f7bdf65ce68e1b49a898", "ja": "あっ、こっちに雑誌が置いてあるヨ。古めの……\nあれ？　なんだか、見たコトあるようナ……？", "zh": "啊，这边放着一本杂志耶。看起来有点旧……\n咦？总觉得好像在哪里见过……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "8863b09faf5755c2e6339c79426b996bafd45c9db2878c1fc5078768a511ce66", "ja": "90年代で読んだ、ファッション雑誌と似てる！\nちょうどこんな感じだったよね？", "zh": "跟我以前看过的90年代时尚杂志很像！\n当时正好就是这种感觉对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "45723b92617c06cccf16b006b7bc1bd5d2a31ac17c82b86f3e5940e5ac00d2b1", "ja": "きっとPV撮影の時に使う小道具だな。\nははっ。カセットテープもあって、懐かしいな。", "zh": "肯定是拍摄PV时要用的小道具。\n哈哈，还有磁带，真让人怀念啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "6bcdaf512d36300f5cf72ab5e5bf592c6830ccc7dfbb2a7479fc4bcc1f341e99", "ja": "でも、あのタイムスリップって、本当のこと\nだったのかナ？　なんだか不思議な気持ちだヨ。", "zh": "不过，那次穿越时空，真的是真的吗？总觉得心情好奇怪呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "7c8d059100a2a24d49fa8cfb45cfdeb4444a6ce0b7cb7d2411e267aed20dc1d5", "ja": "あはは。こうやって90年代のものに囲まれてると、\n確かに混乱しちゃうかも。", "zh": "哈哈，被这样一堆90年代的东西包围着，确实可能会搞不清楚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b1130a5e3408f9e91471ee050f23dbe3de605fc70bffd3dcba4e980d7e43a6c5", "ja": "リバイバルブームだから、なおさらかも？\nこのディスコだって、見分けつかないくらいだし。", "zh": "正因为是复古热潮，说不定更容易混淆吧？\n就连这家迪斯科舞厅，也让人分辨不出来究竟是不是那个年代的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "32553618b0e6c76991ce2737412965d5615d0b0fbdbc89e6c74030eca76bc821", "ja": "タイムスリップなんて、\n普通はなかなか体験しないもんね！", "zh": "穿越时空这种事，平时可不太有机会体验到呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "063312113f736f756dffbc73dd8e9eda481d59e1796b8cf8715005a690437232", "ja": "まあ、一般的ではないよな。劇場の魂と会話は\nしたけど、いまだに夢か幻かって感じで……。", "zh": "确实算不上常见吧。虽然和剧场的灵魂说过话，\n但到现在我都觉得像是在做梦或是幻觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "796b609717c49a603673fe179c951963e13f593a064fd0b31d0ef945b50623e7", "ja": "あっ、劇場に住む幽霊の話？\n私、その話もっと聞きたかったんだ～♪", "zh": "啊，是住在剧场里的幽灵的故事吗？\n我还想再多听一点呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "23332a69093bfca92efe9d3185c4160646b66e3b534aa3c3dfc3e4a595f51877", "ja": "だ、だからそれはダメ！\n幽霊の話はナシだってば！！", "zh": "不、所以说那个不行！\n都说了不要讲幽灵的故事！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "47ef5719083559b9d400926dfcb3344fe1bfede6376dd8c3706181065bc0f056", "ja": "ていうか、そもそも劇場に住んでる幽霊って何！？\n怖すぎるんだけど！", "zh": "话说回来，住在剧场里的幽灵到底是什么啊！？\n也太恐怖了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "4b24fa4825cdedb1f39bd29b33b0a6ed1dddbb6303036b1e25d1d20b9222d99c", "ja": "{$P$}。もしかして、\n劇場の魂って、今でも劇場にいるノ……？", "zh": "{$P$}。难道说，剧场的灵魂现在还在剧场里吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "78c58d104429420224e68def6244bbdd99b093f07ae06897552cabc075af33e0", "ja": "そりゃあ、劇場の魂だから、そうだろうな。\nきっと、今でも劇場でみんなを見守って……。", "zh": "那是当然，毕竟是剧场之魂，应该就是这样吧。想必现在也还在剧场里守护着大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "7527d48c2699b8031c04a82d99b2281f0ce69ada9fae428a598c1ba4649245f4", "ja": "キャー！！！\n聞きたくないヨ～！　怖い～！", "zh": "呀——！！！\n我不想听了啦～！好可怕～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "0b9d418e7e1a6290d47c5c84d348962830db89ca49cc3d89596da02bf88ff5c2", "ja": "{$P$}！\n急に怖い話っぽくするのはズルいって！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n突然把气氛弄得像恐怖故事一样，也太赖皮了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "7d8d20c832eb77531ad5d5533318904fa994d9a107f16a2f8fda63e55d99759f", "ja": "い、いや、そんなつもりは……。", "zh": "不、不是，我不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1bc7072543ff475aab800e6f140432f4a9c098971566cd3d576936652fe746fb", "ja": "ね、ねえ。もしかして、あのプチ合宿……本当は\n90年代じゃなくて、現代だったんじゃない……？", "zh": "喂、喂。难道说，那次小集训……其实不是90年代，而是现代……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "5760468377bd80e1757a47263a9e756472e9ceff5afd3f39a5899d4ee7608cc6", "ja": "え……？\nアユム、どういうこと……？", "zh": "诶……？\n步，你这是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "18b9dde83e3b7e7a807efa6f57706ab9a4af8ef5842fe6b9f16153ed23199828", "ja": "だってさ、ここに90年代のディスコがあるし、\n古い雑誌もCDも集める事はできるし……。", "zh": "因为啊，这里有90年代的迪斯科，而且老杂志和CD也都能收集到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "40d4a4651cbefc6d8cbed163a9bcf599d7dce1d7871ef728f96c4b361a2925dc", "ja": "そっか……{$P$}が、\n90年代って錯覚させようとすれば、できる……？", "zh": "这样啊……只要{$P$}想办法让人产生身处90年代的错觉，就能做到……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "fdccfbc875907d0bbac1c3eef7ef9744c283564cca73b8689696d4d37d55f9bc", "ja": "そう言われると……私たちが90年代に行った\n決定的な証拠って、ないかも……？", "zh": "这么一说……我们去过90年代的决定性证据，好像还真没有……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1037_018ele", "source_sha256": "fdb6cf6c23cb24aaa74329ace35190333b91a2ed2444eeed3f610c4f9aa55ea0", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n劇場にオバケは、いないよネ……？", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n剧场里没有鬼，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1038_p", "source_sha256": "541c9dd875ef75d99fb8667be670c2c9dcc713b95a5bd99fc4aef7295c36c583", "ja": "えっと……。", "zh": "我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "8748fd4fae86eda78b23ccd354c287a575425920eb8e8863dd2e6b66ee38c1d8", "ja": "……ああ！　劇場にオバケなんているわけない！\n実はタイムスリップも、ドッキリだったんだ！", "zh": "……啊！剧场里怎么可能会有鬼嘛！\n其实穿越时空也是整蛊啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "30b02c2141bfa57d09b3be2cdc9a096b1776018190d6f7f9376a3a14b4626e44", "ja": "や、やっぱり……！\nよかったぁ。そうだよね、そうに決まってるよね！", "zh": "果、果然……！\n太好了。就是这样，肯定是这样的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9b6c9f358aaef104e0fb67e4cf30bad4acf12a1b0b3d3c2015a6e5f0b1c97838", "ja": "プチ合宿のために、色々仕掛けてたってコトか！\nなーんだ、すっかりだまされたよ！", "zh": "原来是为了小合宿，安排了各种小把戏啊！\n什么嘛，害得我完全被你骗到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1042_018ele", "source_sha256": "6e61ca1b7cb230ce1ed5103020c82765a415d5cd388956b8d505e3b9c35e6475", "ja": "グスッ。もう、{$P$}ってば、\nイジワルなんだから～！", "zh": "抽泣。真是的，{$P$}，你太坏了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1043_029umi", "source_sha256": "e2a429f7142875dae6fe54900e57caa46325226fb0176c69f234cb60b4ee7159", "ja": "でも、本当にいるなら、個人的には\n会ってみたかったけどな～。劇場の魂。", "zh": "不过，要是真的存在，我个人还真想见见它呢～剧场的灵魂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1044_018ele", "source_sha256": "f1cd633f82a6b5d15678b3b45b3082f3811fae1ecfc6f4193aa1c9ac87bd8ca3", "ja": "う、ウミ！　その話はやめて～！\nやめてくれないなら……ダンスで、勝負だヨ！", "zh": "海、海美！快别说那个话题了～！\n要是不停下来……就用跳舞来决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1045_029umi", "source_sha256": "7cb4494604ab6d67840e8966cb750ce9253f6389dd9066c9f006660cdd804702", "ja": "えっ、えれなんとダンス勝負！？\n楽しそう、受けて立つよ！", "zh": "咦，要和艾莲娜比跳舞！？  \n听起来好有意思，我接受挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fe865a94046ac2335b379f2420bb1bdc897cb91431ac9f97e278528e3cf12715", "ja": "{$P$}！　今日は\nリハーサルだけど、ちょっとだけ練習してもいい？", "zh": "{$P$}！今天虽然只是\n彩排，但我可以稍微练习一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1047_p", "source_sha256": "fcc30e399333cafba4c9f8c79626eb1d6aa12d7234666382cab53e20bb469651", "ja": "うん。最初からそのつもりだし、\n構わないよ。", "zh": "嗯。本来一开始就是这么打算的，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "2b1455d3ba522268164e0edcea9d436e5ee49bcadb73bdcc009c3d0d76e90546", "ja": "よーし、それじゃあみんなで踊ろう！\n……嫌なこと全部、忘れちゃうまで！", "zh": "好——那我们大家一起跳舞吧！\n……直到把所有不开心的事全都忘掉为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1049_034ayu", "source_sha256": "854d8e5346faf84c9ab1092fb3ef98ca1cc9cda248e5ea06ca5c7210edf032de", "ja": "イエーイ！", "zh": "耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1050_043nor", "source_sha256": "854d8e5346faf84c9ab1092fb3ef98ca1cc9cda248e5ea06ca5c7210edf032de", "ja": "イエーイ！", "zh": "耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1051_029umi", "source_sha256": "854d8e5346faf84c9ab1092fb3ef98ca1cc9cda248e5ea06ca5c7210edf032de", "ja": "イエーイ！", "zh": "耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1052_018ele", "source_sha256": "854d8e5346faf84c9ab1092fb3ef98ca1cc9cda248e5ea06ca5c7210edf032de", "ja": "イエーイ！", "zh": "耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1053_p", "source_sha256": "d73a6bfe1cbb22aa360fd0b50107fe2391ab88539e75479aa6ef568261b744e3", "ja": "（このチームなら、どの時代だって最高の形で\nまとまってくれた……そんな気がするな！）", "zh": "（这个团队不管在哪个时代，都能以最棒的形式凝聚在一起……我有这种感觉！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_07_1054_p", "source_sha256": "68f324d87ca9fadf97f2b26bacbf772918770f41d78fea45c2cd7ea54a27efa0", "ja": "（でも……劇場の魂には、やっぱり専用の神棚を\n作ってあげたほうがいいかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（不过……剧场之魂，果然还是给它做一个专用的神龛比较好吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
